  "summary": "武曲财星会魁钺，被古赋联想到金融财赋职业；旺宫可显官贵，陷宫作用减。作者强调只代表理财倾向，不能断必从金融业；命宫之外事业、财帛或迁移也可类论但较弱。魁钺等乙丙级星须依同宫甲级星旺弱，不可独断。引用「命恒」疑字照留。",
  "summary_en": "Inherited verses associate Military Melody meeting Kui Yue with financial occupations: strong placement favors prominence, whereas fallen placement weakens it. The author cautions that this indicates financial-management tendencies, not a guaranteed profession. Career, Wealth or Travel placements may show similar but weaker effects than Life. Minor stars such as Kui Yue must be interpreted with their accompanying major stars and their strength, not independently. The unclear quoted Ming Heng wording is preserved.",
